      "id": "claim_496e823169644726b5b139d7c69a0b90",
      "statement": "ocm.Client stores its connection behind the narrow ocmConnection interface (Tokens, Close) rather than the concrete *sdkClient.Connection, specifically so tests can substitute a mockConnection via Client.buildConn; Client.sdkConn() type-asserts back to the concrete connection and errors (rather than panicking) when given a fake.",
